{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04947","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 薛稷","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主家园囿极新规，帝郊游豫奉天仪。\n欢宴瑶台镐京集，赏赐铜山蜀道移。\n曲阁交映金精板，飞花乱下珊瑚枝。\n借问今朝八龙驾，何如昔日望仙池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}